{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S06等段落仍有较多感受提示，即使分时出现，观众也可能忙于追读而分散听音乐的注意力；Y的短词组合在快速获取整体情绪上更轻松。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的核心，让普通观众即使不逐字阅读，也能抓住人物当下的处境；感受文字缩小并按音乐时点出现，又让观众有机会把具体的音乐变化和人物心理联系起来。更重要的是，X把舍不得、记起受过的气、害怕孤单、重新理解离开、决定继续生活之间的因果和反复呈现得更清楚，音乐感受也更有层次；Y虽然短词便于快速浏览，但不少感受只是并列堆放，情绪转折与人物心理之间的联系不如X清晰。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f378005f-afa4-443c-9ad3-60b1778f0dce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T002109990403Z", "elapsed_seconds": 58.14, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:22:08.141826+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b5094e73d2696cbd05c9105cc0c0941048c5481002825b2aeca30929ba035227", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", 